  "post_title": "El Museo de la Baronía de Ribesalbes continua la temporada de exposiciones con collages de Yao Flores",
  "post_date": "2019-12-08 11:43:37",
  "post_name": "el-museo-de-la-baronia-de-ribesalbes-continua-la-temporada-de-exposiciones-con-collages-de-yao-flores",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;&#10;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">(20 fotos) El Museo de la Baron&iacute;a de Ribesalbes acoge desde este s&aacute;bado hasta el viernes 20 de diciembre la segunda exposici&oacute;n de la temporada 2019-20, una muestra muy interesante de collages de la artista saguntina afincada en Val&egrave;ncia Yao Flores.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/12/IMG_3813.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;&#10;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">La inauguraci&oacute;n ha corrido a cargo del alcalde C&eacute;sar Pallar&eacute;s Torres, acompa&ntilde;ado de la reina de las fiestas de 2019, Sara Albalat Ruiz, sus dos damas de honor, y componentes de la corporaci&oacute;n municipal.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\">El alcalde ha destacado que la instalaci&oacute;n muse&iacute;stica organiza muchas exposiciones a lo largo del a&ntilde;o, &ldquo;sin duda, el que m&aacute;s de la provincia de Castell&oacute;n&rdquo;.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoyaofloresmuseubaroniaribesalbes/img_3765.jpg\" alt=\"img_3765\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoyaofloresmuseubaroniaribesalbes/img_3766.jpg\" alt=\"img_3766\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoyaofloresmuseubaroniaribesalbes/img_3768.jpg\" alt=\"img_3768\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoyaofloresmuseubaroniaribesalbes/img_3770.jpg\" alt=\"img_3770\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoyaofloresmuseubaroniaribesalbes/img_3774.jpg\" alt=\"img_3774\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoyaofloresmuseubaroniaribesalbes/img_3778.jpg\" alt=\"img_3778\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoyaofloresmuseubaroniaribesalbes/img_3779.jpg\" alt=\"img_3779\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoyaofloresmuseubaroniaribesalbes/img_3781.jpg\" alt=\"img_3781\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoyaofloresmuseubaroniaribesalbes/img_3783.jpg\" alt=\"img_3783\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoyaofloresmuseubaroniaribesalbes/img_3786.jpg\" alt=\"img_3786\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoyaofloresmuseubaroniaribesalbes/img_3788.jpg\" alt=\"img_3788\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoyaofloresmuseubaroniaribesalbes/img_3790.jpg\" alt=\"img_3790\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoyaofloresmuseubaroniaribesalbes/img_3792.jpg\" alt=\"img_3792\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoyaofloresmuseubaroniaribesalbes/img_3793.jpg\" alt=\"img_3793\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoyaofloresmuseubaroniaribesalbes/img_3799.jpg\" alt=\"img_3799\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/e